                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee291306-5834-41f0-9ab0-8e96492ff517",
                                                "sense_id": "82d02cc5-cdf7-3f4a-824c-ced1752b06f3",
                                                "text": "The merits and limitations of Kyoto have been subject to great discussion. Some criticize the regime for being too top-down, wasteful and infective as a means of tacking climate change (Prins and Rayner 2007; Victor 2001)."
